              Provides attributed reliability evaluations from classical rijāl authorities and teacher-student networks.
            </p>

            <div class="project-stats-band" aria-label="Transmitter statistics">
              <div class="project-stat-item">
                <span class="project-stat-item__num">24,300+</span>
                <span class="project-stat-item__lbl">Transmitters</span>
              </div>
              <div class="project-stat-item">
                <span class="project-stat-item__num">14</span>
                <span class="project-stat-item__lbl">Generations</span>
              </div>
              <div class="project-stat-item">
                <span class="project-stat-item__num">Networked</span>
                <span class="project-stat-item__lbl">Teacher–Student</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="project-module-card__pills-row">
              <span class="project-pills-label">Evaluative Apparatus</span>
              <div class="project-pills">
                <span class="project-pill">Ibn Ḥajar (Taqrīb)</span>
                <span class="project-pill">Al-Dhahabī (Mīzān)</span>
                <span class="project-pill">Network Trees</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="project-module-card__footer">
              <span class="project-module-card__cta">
                Browse register <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
