          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- BOTTOM FULL-WIDTH MODULE: ACADEMIC STUDIES & ICMA MONOGRAPHS -->
        <a href="/projects/academic-studies" class="project-workbench-banner project-workbench-banner--link">
          <div class="project-workbench-banner__main">
            <div class="project-workbench-banner__header">
              <span class="project-workbench-banner__kicker">ICMA Archive & Critical Register</span>
            </div>

            <div class="project-workbench-banner__title-row">
              <h3 class="project-workbench-banner__title">Academic Studies & ICMA Monographs</h3>
              <span class="project-workbench-banner__ar" dir="rtl" lang="ar">الدراسات الأكاديمية ونقد الأسانيد والمتون</span>
            </div>

            <p class="project-workbench-banner__desc">
              Specialized research repository of 27 isnād-cum-matn monographs and the complete 17-part Harald Motzki case study corpus—correlating transmission chains with textual variation to reconstruct early historical horizons.
